                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="section-eyebrow-label">Our Story</div>
                </div>
                <div class="about-story-text">
                  <h2 class="about-story-heading">Arcline began with one frustration: too much talk, not <span class="heading-accent">enough<div class="heading-accent-line is-circle is-pos-circle-story w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 145 45" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <path d="M90 6.48C95.34 5.67 100.6 5.14 105.74 5.01M105.74 5.01C116.37 4.73 126.51 6.15 135.83 10.25C146.52 14.96 147.26 22.91 134.84 29.68C122.81 36.22 103.93 39.21 88.62 41.15C72.5 43.19 56 44.35 40.49 43.88C26.99 43.47 11.36 42.07 4.04 36.59C-1 32.8 0.65 27.6 5.87 22.91C19.37 10.79 49.56 2.67 73.97 1.2C87.1 0.42 96.83 1.95 105.74 5.01ZM105.74 5.01C110.09 6.5 114.24 8.35 118.5 10.48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></path>
                        </svg></div></span> action.</h2>
                  <div class="about-story-paragraphs">
                    <p class="text-size-regular">Our founders had spent years inside growing companies — running operations, closing books, launching products. They had seen brilliant strategies stall in the gap between the boardroom and the business.</p>
                    <p class="text-size-regular">So they built a firm that closes that gap. Senior people on every engagement, recommendations sized to your resources, and a team that stays until the change is real.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
